Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(mcp): implement HealthAlert Companion MCP server and
 Alexa+ conversational agent

- Rename ST Cool to HealthAlert Companion across navigation, components, and services
- Expose Model Context Protocol (MCP) server endpoints on /api/mcp with JSON-RPC 2.0 protocol (2024-11-05)
- Implement real MCP tools: check_safety_escalation, explain_health_alert, prepare_follow_up_questions
- Implement conversational agent orchestrator (/api/health-alert/agent) with deterministic safety precedence
- Add Alexa+ agent experience panel with synthetic demo scenarios and live tool execution trace
- Add automated verification suite scripts/test-mcp-agent.ts
